# Merge And Deploy Gates

Merge requires:
- lint pass
- build pass
- unit pass
- critical integration pass
- no infra or DB change without explicit approval

Deploy requires:
- health check
- version check
- migration plan when needed
- rollback plan

For risky changes:
- prefer stepwise rollout
- define rollback trigger before deployment
